      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I can certainly help you draft those scripts for your retail rollout. For the \"Standard Professional\" version, keep the language formal and highly structured, focusing on policy and timelines. For the \"Relatable/Casual\" version, you should use more colloquial language, perhaps injecting some mild, self-aware humor to sound more like a peer. This approach will help you tailor the tone to different demographics, which is key for maximizing rapport.",
