      "content": "That makes sense. Could you actually give me some concrete examples of what those two versions would look like? Like, if a customer asks \"where is my package?\", show me the Professional one vs the \"Relatable\" one for those urban areas. I want to see the specific difference in the wording and slang so I can show my team.",
